<title>USA: Property Capital Trust Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Property Capital Trust Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 2.00		  $  0.06</p>
<p> Net			 19,099			526</p>
<p> Fund From oper	   1,505		    1,770</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   9,520		    9,085</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 net includes gain of $1.95 per share on sale of City Centre Holiday Inn Investment.</p>
<p>Funds from operation defined as net income excluding gains/losses from sale of properties, extraordinary and non-recurring items, plus depreciation and amortization and after adjustment for unconsolidated partnerships or joint ventures.</p>
<p>1997 Q1 Funds from operation per share was $0.16 vs $0.19 in year-ago period.</p>
